    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="146" status="pending">Edits AnalysisEndpoints.cs at the fork/promote create sites (:1207, :1405) for owner stamping. Not a functional dependency: the checks here run BEFORE those creates. Rebase onto whichever lands first; keep both behaviours.</dependency>
