      <dependency task="167" status="not yet authored when this was written">Extends RouteAuthorizationGuardTests to every route file and adds Pending waivers for the 82 findings. If 167 is on this branch, delete its waivers for the six routes. If it is not, follow the fallback in the guard constraint; the main session reconciles waivers at integration.</dependency>
