    <patterns>
      <pattern name="per-route target declaration with Document, Record and Privilege paths, fail closed" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs:292-425">Resolve targets from the route's own source, reject validation errors before any rights query, evaluate each check as the caller, deny on any fault, uniform 404 where the id is the route's own, G5 (Create privilege + AppendTo on parents) for an app-created row.</pattern>
